# 统一行尾：脚本与 CI 配置强制 LF，避免在 Linux 环境出现 CRLF 解析错误
*.sh          text eol=lf
*.yml         text eol=lf
*.yaml        text eol=lf
*.sql         text eol=lf
*.go          text eol=lf
*.bat         text eol=crlf
*.ps1         text eol=crlf

# 工具与缓存
*.exe         binary
*.zip         binary
*.tar.gz      binary
*.db          binary
